    "When you open a game, Cartouche asks MacGamingDB for its Mac reports. MacGamingDB sees which game, but no account or Mac identifier." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quando apri un gioco, Cartouche chiede a MacGamingDB le sue segnalazioni Mac. MacGamingDB vede quale gioco, ma nessun account né identificativo del Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开游戏时，Cartouche 会向 MacGamingDB 获取该游戏的 Mac 报告。MacGamingDB 能看到是哪款游戏，但看不到任何账户或 Mac 标识符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you open a game, Cartouche asks MacGamingDB for its Mac reports. No account or Mac identifier is sent." : {
